#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Xa kuvuliwe, i-Auto Scale Option ekhethiweyo imisela ukuba yeyiphi imida esetyenziswa yi-RRDtool: --alt-autoscale ayihoyi zombini imida, --alt-autoscale-max igcina umda osezantsi, --alt-autoscale-min igcina umda ophezulu, kwaye --alt-autoscale (ukwamkela zombini imida) igcina zombini imida. Xa kukhubaziwe, imida esezantsi neyaphezulu eqwalaselweyo isetyenziswa ngqo. I-Rigid Boundaries ilawula ukuba amaxabiso angaphandle kwaloo mida ayalwandisa na uluhlu lwegrafu."

