#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Uqinisekiso oluKhelwe ngaphakathi</i> - I-Kadupul ilawula uqinisekiso lomsebenzisi, okukuvumela ukuba uyile abasebenzisi kwaye ubanike amalungelo kwiindawo ezahlukeneyo ngaphakathi kwe-Kadupul.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso oluSisiseko lweWebhu</i> - Uqinisekiso lulawulwa yiseva yewebhu. Abasebenzisi banokudityaniswa okanye bayilwe ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba uMsebenzisi weSakhelo uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zondwendwe ezichaziweyo.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP</i> - Luvumela uqinisekiso ngokuchasene neseva ye-LDAP. Abasebenzisi baya kuyilwa ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba uMsebenzisi weSakhelo uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zondwendwe ezichaziweyo. Ukuba imojuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP ayivulwanga, uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP aluyi kuvela njengokhetho olunokukhethwa.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lweDomeyini eNinzi ye-LDAP/AD</i> - Luvumela abalawuli ukuba baxhase amaqela amaninzi ahlukileyo avela kwizikhombisi ezahlukeneyo ze-LDAP/AD ukuze bafikelele kwizibonelelo ze-Kadupul. Kanye njengoqinisekiso lwe-LDAP, imojuli ye-PHP LDAP iyafuneka ukusebenzisa le ndlela.</blockquote>"

