#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ngokusisiseko, uMqokeleli weDatha oPhambili we-Kadupul uya kugcina yonke iwebhusayithi kunye neeplagini kuVimba weZibonelelo. Emva koko, ngamaxesha athile abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude baya kuzihlaziya ngalo naluphi na uhlaziyo oluvela kuMqokeleli weDatha oPhambili we-Kadupul. Lo Vimba weZibonelelo ngokusisiseko uvumela abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude ukuba baziphucule. Ukuba awufuni ukusebenzisa olu khetho, ungalukhubaza usebenzisa olu seto."

