msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Igama le-host le-DNS okanye idilesi ye-IP yeseva ye-backup proxy ye-RRDtool ukuba i-proxy isebenza kwimowudi ye-MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Igama le-host le-DNS okanye idilesi ye-IP yeseva ye-proxy ye-RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ii-Thread ezimiselweyo ezivumelekileyo ngenkqubo nganye.  QAPHELA: Ukusukela kwi-Kadupul 1.2+, le setingi igcinwa kuMqokeleli weDatha, kwaye oku sisicwangciso sangaphambili nje.  Ukusebenzisa inani eliphezulu xa usebenzisa i-Spine kuya kuphucula ukusebenza.  Nangona kunjalo, qinisekisa ukuba unoqhagamshelwano olwaneleyo lwe-MySQL/MariaDB ukuxhasa eli nxalenye: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Kufuneka kwakhona uqinisekise ukuba unoqhagamshelwano olongezelelweyo olwaneleyo lokungena kwabasebenzisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the Primary Kadupul Admins Email account."
msgstr "Idilesi ye-imeyile yokuthumela ii-Imeyile zeZaziso zokuZenzekelayo ukuba ayichazwanga kwinqanaba leNethiwekhi yokuZenzekelayo.  Ukuba le ndawo, okanye ixabiso leNethiwekhi yokuZenzekelayo zishiywe zingenanto, i-Kadupul iya kusebenzisa i-akhawunti ye-Imeyile yabalawuli abaphambili be-Kadupul."

