msgstr "Umthi wegrafu omiselweyo wokusebenzisa xa kuboniswa iigrafu kwimowudi yomthi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu elimiselweyo lee-OID ze-SNMP Get zokukhupha kwisicelo ngasinye se-snmpget.  Kwizixhobo, le setingi ilawulwa kwinqanaba leSixhobo.  Kufuneka usebenzise le setingi kuphela xa usebenzisa i-SNMP API ye-Kadupul kwizikripthi okanye kwii-plugin zakho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of Device Threads.  This is only applicable when using the Spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Inani elimiselweyo lee-Thread zeSixhobo.  Oku kusebenza kuphela xa usebenzisa uMqokeleli weDatha we-Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Inani elimiselweyo leenkqubo ezisebenzayo ngaxeshanye zokuqhuba kuMqokeleli weDatha ngamnye.  QAPHELA: Ukusukela kwi-Kadupul 1.2, le setingi igcinwa kuMqokeleli weDatha.  Ukuya phambili, eli xabiso lisisicwangciso sangaphambili kuphela soMqokeleli weDatha.  Ukusebenzisa inani eliphezulu xa usebenzisa i-cmd.php kuya kuphucula ukusebenza.  Ukuphuculwa kokusebenza kwi-Spine kulungiswa ngcono ngepharamitha yee-thread.  Xa usebenzisa i-Spine, sicebisa inani eliphantsi kunye nokusebenzisa ii-thread endaweni yoko.  Xa usebenzisa i-cmd.php, ungasebenzisi ngaphezulu kwe-2x yenani lee-CPU cores."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to display on for a table."
msgstr "Inani elimiselweyo lemiqolo yokubonisa kwitheyibhile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to return from an autocomplete based select pattern match."
msgstr "Inani elimiselweyo lemiqolo yokubuyiswa kwiphethini yokukhangela esekelwe kwi-autocomplete."

#: include/global_settings.php
