msgid "The font to use for Graph Legends.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Ifonti yokusebenzisa kwii-Legend zegrafu.  Faka inkcazo yefonti ye-Pango, njenge-DejaVu Sans Bold. I-RRDtool ayilayishi iifayile zefonti."

