msgstr "Ifonti yokusebenzisa kwizinto ze-Unit yegrafu.  Faka inkcazo yefonti ye-Pango, njenge-DejaVu Sans Bold. I-RRDtool ayilayishi iifayile zefonti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ixesha oza kuqaliswa ngalo umqokeleli wedatha we-Kadupul.  Ungasebenzisa nokuba yi-crontab, umsebenzi ocwangcisiweyo (kwi-Windows), okanye inkonzo ye-systemd ye-cactid ukulawula ukuqaliswa komqokeleli wedatha we-Kadupul.  Ngemiyalelo yokusebenzisa i-daemon ye-cactid, hlola ifayile ye-README.md kuvimba we-service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The height of Thumbnail graphs in pixels."
msgstr "Ubude beegrafu zemifanekiso emincinci ngee-pixel."

