msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Ubungakanani obukhulu bememori ye-Kadupul Poller kunye ne-Data Source Statistics Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Background Commands ye-Kadupul esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokudala imposiso yexesha lokuphelelwa size sibulawe.  Esi sikripthi siya kwenza imisebenzi efana nokuphindaphinda izalathiso zeZixhobo nokucutha izixhobo kubaqokeleli bedatha abakude."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Data Source Statistics ye-Kadupul esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokudala imposiso yexesha lokuphelelwa size sibulawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi sokuhlola i-RRDfile ye-Kadupul esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokudala imposiso yexesha lokuphelelwa size sibulawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi sokuvelisa iingxelo ze-Kadupul esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokudala imposiso yexesha lokuphelelwa size sibulawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi soLondolozo lwe-Kadupul esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokudala imposiso yexesha lokuphelelwa size sibulawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Spikekill ye-Kadupul esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokudala imposiso yexesha lokuphelelwa size sibulawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Elona nani likhulu lee-Device Directories eziya kudalwa ngokusekelwe kwii-Device ID ezi-hashed."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Obukhulu ubungakanani bomyalezo we-E-Mail kuquka zonke izihlomelo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide i-spine eya kulinda iskripthi ukuba sigqibe.  Eli xabiso lexesha lokuphelelwa lingemizuzwana kwaye lisebenza kuphela kuMqokeleli weDatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Kadupul after their Data Sources are deleted."
msgstr "Indlela esetyenziselwa ukucoca ii-RRDfile kwi-Kadupul emva kokuba imithombo yazo yedatha icinyiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Ezona sampuli zininzi ezaliweyo umthombo wedatha omnye onokuzigcina kumgca.  Ezona sampuli zindala ezingaphaya kwalo mda zihanjiswa kwitheyibhile ye-poller_output_rejected ngoko nangoko."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi ongumhambeli lokubukela iigrafu; ngu-'No User' ngokungagqibekanga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Igama le-akhawunti yomlawuli eyintloko eya kufumana ii-Imeyile ngokuzenzekelayo xa inkqubo ye-Kadupul ifumana iingxaki.  Ukufumana ezi Imeyile, qinisekisa ukuba iisetingi zakho zemeyile zichanekile, kwaye i-akhawunti yomlawuli inedilesi ye-Imeyile esetiweyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi eliza kusetyenziswa yi-Kadupul njengokulinganisa kwabasebenzisi abatsha be-Web Basic ne-LDAP; ngu-'guest' ngokungagqibekanga.  Le akhawunti yomsebenzisi iya kukhubazwa ekungeneni xa ikhethiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Inani lemigaqo yezilumkiso efundwayo nevavanywa kunye. Isabelo sexesha sihlolwa phakathi kwamaqela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Preview mode."
msgstr "Inani leekholam zokusebenzisa xa kuboniswa iigrafu zemifanekiso emincinci kwimowudi ye-Preview."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Tree mode."
msgstr "Inani leekholam zokusebenzisa xa kuboniswa iigrafu zemifanekiso emincinci kwimowudi yoMthi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo ze-DSStats ezisebenzayo ngaxeshanye zokusebenzisa ukucubungula yonke iMithombo yeDatha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo ze-Poller Command ezisebenzayo ngaxeshanye.  Kuya kubakho ubuninzi bomyalelo omnye osebenzayo ngaxeshanye ngomamkeli ngamnye ngaphakathi kwi-Poller Command pool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process all of rrd files."
