#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo ze-boost ezisebenzayo ngaxeshanye zokusebenzisa ukucubungula zonke ii-RRD kwitheyibhile ye-boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo zeseva yeskripthi ezisebenzayo ngaxeshanye zokuqhuba ngenkqubo nganye ye-spine.  Iisetingi phakathi kwe-1 ne-15 zamkelekile.  Le pharamitha iya kunceda ukuba uqhuba ii-thread ezininzi kunye nezikripthi zeseva yeskripthi kwaye isebenza kuphela kuMqokeleli weDatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Inani leeyure ezilandelelanayo ezimele umndilili weyure nganye.  Khumbula ukuba isetingi ephezulu kakhulu inokukhokelela kwiitheyibhile zememori ezinkulu kakhulu"

#: include/global_settings.php
