#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezintathu zokutshintsha.  Indlela yokuqala itshintsha i-spike ngomndilili womthombo wedatha ochaphazelekayo.  Indlela yesibini itshintsha i-spike nge-'NaN'.  Eyokugqibela itshintsha i-spike ngexabiso elilungileyo lokugqibela elifunyenweyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezimbini zokususa.  Eyokuqala, Ukwahluka okusemgangathweni, iya kususa nayiphi na isampuli ekude ngamanani a-X wokwahluka okusemgangathweni ukusuka kumndilili weesampuli.  Indlela yesibini, i-Variance, iya kususa nayiphi na isampuli engu-X% ngaphezulu komndilili we-Variance.  Indlela ye-Variance ithathela ingqalelo inani elithile lee-'outliers'.  Ezo ziisampuli ezingaqhelekanga, njenge-spike, ekufuneka zikhutshelwe ngaphandle kubalo loMndilili we-Variance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ezi setingi zigcinwa kwinqanaba loMqokeleli weDatha.  Amaxabiso apha angumiselweyo kuphela asetyenziswayo xa kuqala ukudalwa uMqokeleli weDatha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Le yi-akhawunti ye-imeyile esetyenziselwa ukuthumela umyalezo wovavanyo ukuqinisekisa ukuba yonke into isebenza ngokufanelekileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Le yindawo yeseva eya kusetyenziselwa amakhonkco aya kwisayithi ye-Kadupul. Oku kufuneka kubandakanye uvimba ongaphantsi ukuba i-Kadupul ayisebenzi ukusuka kwifolda ye-root."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Eli linani loonobumba abaya kuvunyelwa ngaphambi kokuba umgca okwi-Imeyile usongwe ngokuzenzekelayo. (0 = Kukhubaziwe)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Eli lelona nani likhulu leentsuku ngaphambi kokuba igama lokugqitha lisetelwe ukuphelelwa lixesha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Eli lelona nani likhulu leentsuku ngaphambi kokuba ii-akhawunti ezingasebenziyo zikhubazwe.  I-akhawunti ye-Admin ayibandakanywa kulo mgaqo-nkqubo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Obu bobona bude buncinci bamagama okugqitha avumelekileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Le yidilesi ye-imeyile eya kuvela ivela kuyo i-Imeyile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Eli ligama lokwenyani eliya kuvela livela kulo i-Imeyile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the directory where RRDfiles are <strong>moved</strong> for archiving"
msgstr "Lo nguvimba apho ii-RRDfile <strong>zihanjiswe</strong> khona ukuze zigcinwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Eli ligama le-host/i-IP yeSeva ye-SMTP oya kuthumela kuyo i-Imeyile. Ukulungiselela i-failover, ahlula abamkeli bakho usebenzisa i-semi-colon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Le yindawo, kweseva yewebhu apho ii-RRDfile kunye neefayile ze-PNG ziya kugcinwa kwi-cache.  Le cache iya kulawulwa yi-poller.  Qinisekisa ukuba uneemvume ezichanekileyo zokufunda nokubhala kule folda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Eli lelona xesha lincinci elixhaswayo phakathi kohlaziyo lweGrafu.  Eli xabiso likwasetyenziselwa ukuseta iimpawu ezithile ze-RRDfile.  Ukuba uneSixhobo esigcina idatha kwi-cache kwaye singaboneleli ngohlaziyo lwexesha lokwenyani, kunokufuneka wandise i-Minimum Refresh Interval emiselweyo ukuthintela ukudala iiGrafu ezinezikhewu."

