msgstr "Oku kubhekisa kuphawu oluthile ngaphakathi kuluhlu lwe-LDAP olugcina amagama abasebenzisi bamalungu eqela. Kubalulekile ukuqinisekisa ukuba ixabiso lophawu lihambelana noqwalaselo oluchazwe kwi-\"Distinguished Name\" okanye ukuba ixabiso lophawu lokwenyani liyakhangelwa kusetyenziswa iisetingi ezichazwe kwi-\"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Le setingi yeyenkqubo ye-poller enye kuphela yokwakha ngokutsha itheyibhile ye-poller output kumjikelo ngamnye wokuqokelela ukuthintela itheyibhile yememori ekutshintsheni kwiinkqubo ezinkulu kakhulu ezineziseko zedatha ezinkulu ezinokusebenzisa i-swap."

