msgstr "Xa usebenzisa uqinisekiso olusisiseko, ukuba kukho iingxaki zokumaphisha igama lomsebenzisi kwi-akhawunti ye-Kadupul esebenzayo, umyalezo oqukwe apha uya kuboniswa abasebenzisi.  Unokubandakanya zombini umbhalo kunye ne-HTML."

