msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Indlela i-Whitelisting esebenza ngayo kukuba xa ungenisa okokuqala iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha, okanye uphinda ungenise iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha, kwaye iskripthi kunye/okanye iimpikiswano zitshintsha nangayiphi na indlela, iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha, nayo yonke iMithombo yeDatha ehambelanayo iya kukhubazwa ngoko nangoko de umlawuli aqinisekise ukuba iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha iyasebenza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Then run the following within MySQL as an administrator:"
msgstr "Emva koko uqhube oku kulandelayo ngaphakathi kwe-MySQL njengomlawuli:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Kadupul was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Kadupul more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Kadupul administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Ngoko ke, kwinguqulelo ezininzi ezidlulileyo, i-Kadupul yaphuculwa ukuze inikezele ngokukwazi kwe-Whitelist kwezi ntlobo zeeNdlela zeGalelo leDatha.  Nangona oku kuyikhusela ngokucokisekileyo i-Kadupul, kuyawandisa umsebenzi ofunwa ngumlawuli we-Kadupul ukungenisa nokulawula iiTempleyithi neePakethe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Kadupul system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Ezi setingi zokulungisa ukusebenza kwe-MySQL ziya kunceda inkqubo yakho ye-Kadupul isebenze ngcono ngaphandle kweengxaki ixesha elide."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Kadupul remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Kadupul Web Site changes"
msgstr "Le mimba iya kufuneka ukuba ihlale ifundeka kwaye ibhaleka emva kokufaka ukuze inkqubo yongqamaniso ekude ye-Kadupul ikwazi ukuyihlaziya njengoko iWebhusayithi ePhambili ye-Kadupul itshintsha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This error may also be generated if the cacti database user does not have correct permissions on the Kadupul database. Please ensure that the Kadupul database user has the ability to SELECT, INSERT, DELETE, UPDATE, CREATE, ALTER, DROP, INDEX on the Kadupul database."
msgstr "Le mposiso inokudalwa kwakhona ukuba umsebenzisi wesiseko sedatha we-cacti akanazo iimvume ezichanekileyo kwisiseko sedatha se-Kadupul. Nceda uqinisekise ukuba umsebenzisi wesiseko sedatha we-Kadupul unokukwazi ukwenza SELECT, INSERT, DELETE, UPDATE, CREATE, ALTER, DROP, INDEX kwisiseko sedatha se-Kadupul."

