msgid "Your Kadupul database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Kadupul database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yokungena yesiseko sedatha ye-Kadupul ayinakufikelela kwisiseko sedatha se-MySQL TimeZone.  Nceda unike i-akhawunti yesiseko sedatha ye-Kadupul ukufikelela kwe-\"select\" kwitheyibhile ye-\"time_zone_name\" kwisiseko sedatha se-\"mysql\", kwaye uzalise ulwazi lwe-TimeZone ye-MySQL ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Isiseko sakho sedatha se-MySQL TimeZone asizalisiwanga.  Nceda uzalise esi siseko sedatha ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Kadupul Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Kadupul database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Ulwazi lwakho lwe-Remote Kadupul Poller alufakwanga kwifayile yakho ye-config.php.  Nceda uhlole i-config.php.dist, uze usete izinto ezitshintshayo: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, njl.  Ezi zinto zitshintshayo kufuneka zisetwe kwaye zikhombe emva kweseva yakho yesiseko sedatha ye-Primary Kadupul.  Lungisa oku uze uzame kwakhona."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Ifayile yakho ye-config.php kufuneka ibhaleke yiseva yewebhu ngexesha lokufaka ukuze kuqwalaselwe i-Remote poller.  Xa ufakelo lugqityiwe, kufuneka usete le fayile ibe yi-Read Only ukuthintela iingxaki zokhuseleko ezinokubakho."

