#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "I-Cache yoMbuzo weDatha igcina ulwazi oluqokelelwe kwiintlobo zegalelo loMbuzo weDatha. Amaxabiso avela kwezi ndawo angasetyenziswa kwindawo yombhalo yeeGrafu kwiincazelo, iiLebhile eziNkqonkqozayo, kunye ne-GPRINTS nakwi-CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Ilogi ye-Kadupul igcina iinkcukacha-manani, iimposiso neminye imiyalezo ngokweesetingi zenkqubo.  Olu lwazi lunokusetyenziswa ukuchonga iingxaki kwi-poller nakwi-aplikheyishini."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "I-Poller Cache iya kuphinda iveliswe ukuba ukhetha olu khetho. Sebenzisa olu khetho kuphela xa kuthe kwakho ukonakala kwesiseko sedatha ukuba ufumana iingxaki emva kokonakala kwaye sele uqhube izixhobo zokulungisa isiseko sedatha.  Okanye, ukuba uneengxaki ngesixhobo esithile, vele ugcine kwakhona eso Sixhobo ukuze wakhe ngokutsha i-Poller Cache yaso.  Kukwakho nomyalelo we-CLI olingana nalo myalelo ocetyiswayo kwiinkqubo ezinkulu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "I-cache ye-SNMP iya kucinywa kwaye iphinde iveliswe ukuba ukhetha olu khetho. Qaphela ukuba kuthatha omnye umjikelo we-poller ukubuyisela i-cache ye-SNMP ngokupheleleyo."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The minimum required can vary greatly if there is heavy user Graph viewing activity."
msgstr "Ubuncinci obufunekayo bunokwahluka kakhulu ukuba kukho umsebenzi omkhulu wokubukela iigrafu ngabasebenzisi."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Le yidatha edluliselwa kwi-poller ngalo lonke ixesha isebenza. Le datha iye iqhutywe/itolikwe kwaye iziphumo zifakwe kwii-RRDfile ukuze zenziwe igrafu okanye kwisiseko sedatha ukuze ziboniswe."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view the latest events SNMP Agent has handled in relation to the registered notification receivers."
msgstr "Olu khetho lwemenyu lukuvumela ukuba ujonge iziganeko zamva nje eziphathwe yi-SNMP Agent ngokunxulumene nabamkeli bezaziso ababhalisiweyo."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view various boost settings and statistics associated with the current running Boost configuration."
msgstr "Olu khetho lwemenyu lukuvumela ukuba ujonge iisetingi ezahlukeneyo ze-boost kunye neenkcukacha-manani ezinxulumene noqwalaselo lwangoku olusebenzayo lwe-Boost."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Olu khetho lwemenyu luya kucima zonke iiNkcukacha-manani zoMthombo weDatha ezikhoyo kwiSiseko seDatha.  Ukuba iiNkcukacha-manani zoMthombo weDatha zivuliwe, iiNkcukacha-manani zeMithombo yeDatha ziya kuqala ukuqokelela kwakhona kumjikelo olandelayo woMqokeleli weDatha."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This shows all objects being handled by the SNMP Agent."
msgstr "Oku kubonisa zonke izinto eziphathwa yi-SNMP Agent."

#: utilities.php
